# Theme.qml references ColorLoader.qml as a sibling type. Being in the
# same plain directory should be enough for that on its own, but a
# singleton loaded through the *root* qmldir (../qmldir) gets its own
# module context rooted there instead of here — so without this file,
# Theme.qml can't see ColorLoader.qml as a type ("ColorLoader is not a
# type"). Registering both files here, even though Theme is already also
# registered in ../qmldir for outside consumers, fixes that.
#
# Metrics registered here too now, even though nothing in ../ needed it
# (every file there reaches Metrics via `import "../"` instead) — added
# so this whole theme/ directory is self-contained and importable on its
# own, which home/quickshell-lock/ now relies on (deployed as its own
# standalone copy, without the rest of src/ alongside it).

singleton Theme Theme.qml
singleton Metrics Metrics.qml
ColorLoader ColorLoader.qml
